      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}’s mom: Let me think...\r",
        "Knowing my boy, he would probably\n",
        "head straight to Jubilife City...\r",
        "OK, please take that to my\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\r"
